{"strongs": "H7273", "word": "רַגְלִי", "translit": "rag.li", "root": "רגל", "morph": "H:A", "pos": "adjective", "gloss": "on foot", "definition": "רַגְלִי adjective on foot ; &; ׳ אִישׁ ר (after number) footmen, especially foot-soldiers, Judg 20:2 ; 2Sam 8:4 = 1Chr 18:4 ; 1Chr 19:18 ( פָּרָשִׁים in || 2Sam 10:18 ); elsewhere ׳ ר as substantive, usually collective, of Israel at Exodus. Exod 12:37 ; Num 11:21 (both J E ); = foot-soldiery 1Sam 4:10 ; 1Sam 15:4 ; 2Sam 10:6 ; 1Kgs 20:29 ; 2Kgs 13:7 plural noun רַגְלִים footmen, men on foot Jer 12:5 (opposed to הַסּוּסִים ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7746')\">BDB7746</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H7273')\">H7273</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7745')\">BDB7745</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7747')\">BDB7747</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>רַגְלִי</bdbheb> <b>adjective</b> <highlightword>on foot</highlightword>; &amp;; <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>אִישׁ ר</bdbheb> (after number) footmen, especially foot-soldiers, <ref ref=\"Judg 20:2\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(7,20,2)\">Judg 20:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 8:4\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(10,8,4)\">2Sam 8:4</ref> = <ref ref=\"1Chr 18:4\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(13,18,4)\">1Chr 18:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 19:18\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(13,19,18)\">1Chr 19:18</ref> (<bdbheb>פָּרָשִׁים</bdbheb> in || <ref ref=\"2Sam 10:18\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(10,10,18)\">2Sam 10:18</ref>); elsewhere <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ר</bdbheb> as substantive, usually collective, of Israel at Exodus. <ref ref=\"Exod 12:37\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"37\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"37\" onclick=\"bcv(2,12,37)\">Exod 12:37</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 11:21\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd